          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP512 Cornett Drive [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My second of two cap finds in Red Deer today. I suspect another cap I looked for is gone due to construction, but since I didn’t sweep for it I still have some doubts. Anyway, this one was a pretty uneventful find in the midday heat. TFTCap.&lt;/p&gt;

